@startuml
title GET /api/v1/objects — Object Not Found Error Path

actor ApiUser
participant Router
participant Controller
participant BucketService
participant "AWSBucketAdapterImpl" as AWSAdapter
participant "AWSClient\n(AWS SDK)" as AWSClient

== Request ==
ApiUser -> Router: 1. GET /api/v1/objects
Router -> Controller: route(request)

Controller -> BucketService: list()
BucketService -> AWSAdapter: list()

== Adapter / SDK ==
AWSAdapter -> AWSClient: 1. listObjects(bucket)

AWSClient --> AWSAdapter: 2. AWSObjectNotFoundException

== Exception Translation ==
activate AWSAdapter
note right of AWSAdapter
catch AWSBucketNotFoundException
throw BucketAdapterObjectNotFoundException
end note
AWSAdapter --> BucketService: 3. BucketAdapterObjectNotFoundException
deactivate AWSAdapter

== Propagation ==
BucketService --> Controller: BucketAdapterObjectNotFoundException

== HTTP Mapping ==
activate Controller
note right of Controller
Map domain exception
to HTTP status code
end note
Controller --> ApiUser: HTTP 404 Not Found
deactivate Controller

@enduml
